37773>>>>
37773>>>        Else Begin
37774>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
37775>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
37776>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
37777>>>        End
37777>>>>
37777>>>    End_Procedure
